{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "似", "id": "似"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "去", "id": "去"}, {"form": "名", "id": "名"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "惡", "id": "惡"}, {"form": "昭", "id": "昭"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "絜", "id": "絜"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.1354942159291497, "source": "亂", "target": "恐"}, {"weight": 1.5260563034950492, "source": "亂", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.7300291078209855, "source": "惡", "target": "似"}, {"weight": 3.4231762883809305, "source": "絜", "target": "似"}, {"weight": 2.4423470353692043, "source": "絜", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.506885556506776, "source": "似", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 2.03688192726104, "source": "似", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 1.8137383759468304, "source": "恐", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 1.120591195386885, "source": "信", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.5260563034950492, "source": "信", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.506885556506776, "source": "信", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.5260563034950492, "source": "信", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.8137383759468304, "source": "知", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "仁", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.6314168191528755, "source": "仁", "target": "賢"}, {"weight": 2.7300291078209855, "source": "去", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.749199854809259, "source": "行", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 3.828641396489095, "source": "使", "target": "昭"}, {"weight": 2.7300291078209855, "source": "使", "t